---
description: Microi native mobile architecture and tenant isolation
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture.md` before editing.
Keep `src/platform`, `src/pages/module`, and shared `mci-*` components tenant
neutral. Put customer code in `src/tenants/<tenant>` and branding/routes in
`profiles/<profile>`. Use sys_menu/diy_table/diy_field metadata and physical
ViewSchema fields. Read metadata only through
`V8.FormEngine.GetDiyTableModel/GetDiyFieldList`; do not query protected
`diy_table/diy_field` with ordinary CRUD or add raw metadata endpoint URLs to
pages and controls. Never use retired DiyConfig, arbitrary frontend V8, eval,
or new Function. Preserve the default xjy delivery and validate both profiles.
